{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEEPLANDERS is a minimalist construction puzzle game about populating the depths.</strong><br><strong>A relaxed experience where you build cozy underground cities while finding the perfect place for each Deeplander to live in harmony.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192550/extras/1d51de88213e1e9ef8e67e435fb6c068.poster.avif?t=1771852656\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192550/extras/1d51de88213e1e9ef8e67e435fb6c068.webm?t=1771852656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192550/extras/1d51de88213e1e9ef8e67e435fb6c068.mp4?t=1771852656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Banished to live underground, these charming characters wander lost in the darkness. As you build, they begin to arrive, searching for a place to settle. Not everyone wants the same thing, and helping each Deeplander find their place becomes a gentle yet engaging logic challenge. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192550/extras/8891872a679f115349dd131bb8282dfe.poster.avif?t=1771852656\" width=600 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192550/extras/8891872a679f115349dd131bb8282dfe.webm?t=1771852656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192550/extras/8891872a679f115349dd131bb8282dfe.mp4?t=1771852656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a city is complete, the choice is yours. You can watch the Deeplanders live their lives while decorating the environment, or venture even deeper. Each descent writes a new chapter in their story, bringing new characters, environments, and ways to build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each depth can be solved in multiple ways, inviting you to replay and create different cities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192550/extras/14c38881f53eb817327f8da88c3e9ca4.poster.avif?t=1771852656\" width=600 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192550/extras/14c38881f53eb817327f8da88c3e9ca4.webm?t=1771852656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192550/extras/14c38881f53eb817327f8da88c3e9ca4.mp4?t=1771852656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please keep in mind that DEEPLANDERS is a small-scale game, made with great care and love. An experience that invites you to build, experiment, and shape small underground cities... because even the depths can be a beautiful place.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In DEEPLANDERS you can:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and decorate underground cities at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve small organization puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a relaxed and contemplative experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay a depth while looking for different solutions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEEPLANDERS does not include:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mining or complex resource management.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles, fail states, or leaderboards.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3192550?t=1771852656","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3192550?t=1771852656","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192550/61dac7ff89f0ad52943bec844e2c8242c819a36f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771852656","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192550/61dac7ff89f0ad52943bec844e2c8242c819a36f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771852656","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3199690,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Support us: wishlist and follow now!</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192550/extras/c6d974516a707dd8c75aa3551c1099c4.poster.avif?t=1771852656\" width=600 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192550/extras/c6d974516a707dd8c75aa3551c1099c4.webm?t=1771852656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192550/extras/c6d974516a707dd8c75aa3551c1099c4.mp4?t=1771852656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEEPLANDERS is a minimalist construction puzzle game about populating the depths.</strong><br><strong>A relaxed experience where you build cozy underground cities while finding the perfect place for each Deeplander to live in harmony.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_